<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-AUSTRIA AWARDED WORLD CUP VICTORY.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-AUSTRIA AWARDED WORLD CUP VICTORY.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria have been awarded a win and three points following Yugoslavia's failure to turn up for their Rugby World Cup qualifier last year.</p>
<p>RWC organisers said they had &quot;no alternative&quot; after the scheduled European Zone pool 1 round A game was called off in October.</p>
<p>Yugoslavia's next match is at home to Switzerland on March 1.</p>
